<div id="shopEditModal" class="about-modal hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="shopEditTitle">
    <div class="about-modal-panel about-edit-panel">
        <button type="button" class="about-close shop-edit-close" aria-label="닫기">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
        </button>
        <h3 id="shopEditTitle" class="about-modal-title">굿즈리스트 수정</h3>
        <form id="shopEditForm" class="about-edit-form">
            <input type="hidden" id="shopEditId">
            <label class="about-edit-label">카드 이름
                <input type="text" id="shopEditCardName" required maxlength="200" placeholder="예: tripleS Come True MD">
            </label>
            <label class="about-edit-label">공연(이벤트)
                <select id="shopEditEventId"></select>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">선택 사항입니다. 연결하면 커버가 비어 있을 때 공연 포스터를 씁니다.</span>
            </label>
            <div id="shopEditGlobalSales" class="about-edit-label">판매 기간
                <div class="stop-date-range shop-sales-period" title="판매 기간">
                    <input type="date" id="shopEditSalesStart" title="시작일" aria-label="판매 시작일">
                    <span class="stop-date-sep" aria-hidden="true">~</span>
                    <input type="date" id="shopEditSalesEnd" title="종료일 (선택)" aria-label="판매 종료일 (선택)">
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">공연을 연결하지 않은 단독 MD용입니다. 시작일은 필수, 종료일은 선택입니다.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-edit-label">MD 공지
                <p id="shopEditMdSalesHint" class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2" hidden>공연을 연결하면 지역·구분·판매 기간을 나눕니다. 공연 없음이면 사진만 올리면 됩니다.</p>
                <div id="shopEditMdBuilder" class="shop-md-builder"></div>
                <div class="shop-md-builder-actions flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-2">
                    <button type="button" id="shopEditMdAddRegion" class="about-mode-btn is-active btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary btn-active" hidden>지역 추가</button>
                </div>
                <input type="file" id="shopEditMdPhoto" accept="image/*" class="hidden" multiple>
                <textarea id="shopEditMdList" class="hidden" hidden aria-hidden="true"></textarea>
            </div>
            <label class="about-edit-label">목록 구분
                <select id="shopEditSectionId"></select>
            </label>
            <label class="about-edit-label">커버 이미지
                <input type="file" id="shopEditImage" accept="image/*">
            </label>
            <label class="about-edit-label">외부 이미지 URL
                <input type="url" id="shopEditImageUrl" placeholder="https://example.com/cover.jpg" maxlength="1000" pattern="https?://.+">
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">비우면 연결 공연 포스터를 씁니다. 파일을 선택하면 파일이 우선 적용됩니다.</span>
            </label>
            <img id="shopEditImagePreview" class="about-preview hidden" alt="커버 미리보기">
            <label class="about-edit-check">
                <input type="checkbox" id="shopEditClearImage"> 커버 이미지 제거 (연결 공연 포스터 사용)
            </label>
            <p id="shopEditError" class="about-edit-error" hidden></p>
            <div class="about-edit-actions">
                <button type="button" id="shopEditDeleteBtn" class="about-mode-btn hidden btn btn-sm btn-error">삭제</button>
                <button type="submit" class="about-mode-btn is-active btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary btn-active">저장</button>
                <button type="button" class="about-mode-btn shop-edit-close btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary">취소</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="shopSectionModal" class="about-modal hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="shopSectionTitle">
    <div class="about-modal-panel about-edit-panel">
        <button type="button" class="about-close shop-section-close" aria-label="닫기">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
        </button>
        <h3 id="shopSectionTitle" class="about-modal-title">구분 관리</h3>
        <form id="shopSectionAddForm" class="about-edit-form" style="margin-bottom:1rem">
            <label class="about-edit-label">구분명 추가
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <input type="text" id="shopSectionNewName" required maxlength="120" placeholder="예: 콘서트, 팬미팅" class="flex-1">
                    <button type="submit" class="about-mode-btn is-active shrink-0 btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary btn-active">추가</button>
                </div>
            </label>
            <p id="shopSectionError" class="about-edit-error" hidden></p>
        </form>
        <ul id="shopSectionList" class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-2"></ul>
        <div class="about-edit-actions" style="margin-top:1rem">
            <button type="button" class="about-mode-btn shop-section-close btn btn-sm btn-outline btn-primary">닫기</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
